解：由格林公式，对于一个由 $z=f(x, y)$ 表示的曲面 $\Sigma$，如果 $ rac{\partial f}{\partial x}= rac{\partial f}{\partial y}=0$，则 $\iint_{\Sigma}  rac{\partial f}{\partial x} d y d z+ rac{\partial f}{\partial y} d z d x = \iint_{\Sigma} d x d y$.
这里 $z=\sqrt{1-x^{2}-y^{2}}(x \leq 0, y \geq 0)$，则 $ rac{\partial z}{\partial x} =  rac{-x}{\sqrt{1-x^{2}-y^{2}}}$，$ rac{\partial z}{\partial y} =  rac{-y}{\sqrt{1-x^{2}-y^{2}}}$.
因为 $ rac{\partial z}{\partial x} 
eq 0$，$ rac{\partial z}{\partial y} 
eq 0$，所以 $ rac{\partial z}{\partial x} 
eq 0$ 且 $ rac{\partial z}{\partial y} 
